  "kind": "kanzi_paper_quantity_weight_grid_search",
  "rationale": "Lift R2 Kanzi overall reconstruction RMSD d_z from -0.0990 (Wave 218 P3, paired N=1000) beyond that baseline (i.e. more negative d_z = framework WINS more strongly) by grid-searching three paper-quantity weights (n_cap_base, sheet_A_weight, cell_C_weight) that control how strongly the scheduler trusts each paper Theorem 1 quantity (Lemma 2 A_g / Lemma 5 B_g / Lemma 3 C_g). packing_B_weight fixed at 1.0.",
